      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's very powerful. I think it hits the right notes. \n\nI'm also worried about some of the harsher critics who claim that prioritizing foreign aid over domestic needs is essentially \"moral negligence\" toward our own citizens. How would you respond to the argument that a nation's primary moral obligation is exclusively to its own people? I want to shut that down in the speech by showing why their view is fundamentally flawed.",
